{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","森罗万象"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","森羅万象"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","生命值较低时回到布阵处扎根。主动释放时击飞目标及其周围敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","HPが低くなると、味方サイド後列に戻って根を差す。アクティブ効果：対象と対象の周囲にいる敵を打ち上げる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥曼斯生命值比例首次低于30%时回到己方后排的空布阵格扎根并恢复30% + 2% HP生命值。扎根状态下，奥曼斯无法移动并处于霸体状态，普通攻击变为远程并对主目标周围1格范围内的其他敌人造成50%的伤害。主动释放时，选择一名敌人，击飞目标及其周围1格范围内的敌人并造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，同时附带4% HP伤害。优先选择攻击范围内敌人最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","HPが初めて30%より低くなった時、味方サイド後列の空いているマスに戻り、根を差してHPを30% + 2% HP回復。根を差した状態の間、移動不可かつスーパーアーマー状態になり、通常攻撃が遠距離攻撃に変化し、メイン対象の周囲1マス範囲内の他の敵に50%のダメージを与えるようになる。アクティブ効果：敵1体を選択し、対象と対象の周囲1マス範囲内の敵を打ち上げ、200% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、追加で4% HPのダメージを与える。優先的に射程距離内にある敵が最も密集しているエリアに向けて発動する"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":138,"end":144,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":53,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":183,"end":189,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":63,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":134,"end":148,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":155,"end":160,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":45,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":75,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":179,"end":193,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":205,"end":210,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが210% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが220% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが230% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが240% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]